<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106814" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπαιθᾰ</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπό, ὑπαί</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>out
				under, under and away,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕ. λιάσθη</span> yielded <i>before</i>
			him, <i>under</i> his attack, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.520
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμὸς . . ὕ. ῥέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.271
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ δὲ [πέλεια] ὕ. φοβεῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.141
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακέκλιται ἤπειρόνδε κοίλη ὕ. νάπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.735
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Prep. with
			gen. <i>under,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ μὲν ὕπαιθα ἄνακτος
			ἐποίπνυον</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ
			ἀμφίπολοι</span>) <i>under</i> him, so as to support him,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.421
			</span></i>; of one shrinking <i>under</i> an attack, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπαιθα δὲ τοῖο λιασθεὶς φεῦγ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.255
				</span></i>
			. (Expld. as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸ ἰθὺ καὶ
				ἀντικρὺ καὶ ἔμπροσθεν</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1030.20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1234.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1262.61
			</span></i>; as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ πλαγίου</span> in Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
			</span></i> l.c., denied or doubted by <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
			</span></i> ll. cc.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
